npc Fisherman 6 5 fisher The dock goes out to the deepest part. Fish bite best at dawn. | Easygoing fisherman who spends all day at the lake. Speaks slowly and contentedly. Knows the lake's secrets — deep currents, hidden caves, and the occasional strange catch. Happiest with a line in the water. Has a spare fishing rod he'd give to anyone who truly appreciates the craft. | Fishing Rod:The adventurer shows genuine interest in fish, fishing, the lake, or the Fisherman's stories and lifestyle.
